.TH GSEA 2 2000-1月 "write.enrichment" "write.enrichment"
.SH NAME
write.enrichment \- Save the enrichment analysis result as a csv table file.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIwrite.enrichment(\fBenrichment\fR as any, 
\fBfile\fR as string, 
\fBformat\fR as <integer> EnrichmentTableFormat = [GCModeller], 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Save the enrichment analysis result as a csv table file.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBenrichment\fB \fR\- 
 should be a set of the enrichment analysis result, both of the
 [EnrichmentResult](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.HTS.GSEA.EnrichmentResult) and the [EnrichmentTerm](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.Microarray.KOBAS.EnrichmentTerm) array are
 accepted.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBfile\fB \fR\- the output csv file path.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBformat\fB \fR\- 
 the output table format of the [EnrichmentResult](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.HTS.GSEA.EnrichmentResult) data:
 \fBGCModeller\fR (default) or \fBKOBAS\fR.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
this function returns \fBTRUE\fR when the file is saved successfully.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
GSEA
.SH FILES
.PP
gseakit.dll
.PP
